d directly from Avantor/VWR Europe or through unnamed local resellers, but no Israeli entity could be identified.', '+1 610 386 1700', NULL, 'One Radnor Corporate Center, Building One, Suite 200, 100 Matsonford Road, Radnor, PA 19087, USA', 'https://corporate.avantorsciences.com/us/en/contact', 'https://corporate.avantorsciences.com/us/en/contact', NULL);
