 Wheaton and Kimble across the 40 Israeli distributor domains and a Hebrew query (''DURAN בקבוקי זכוכית מעבדה יבואן ישראל'') found no Israeli site naming DURAN or KIMBLE, so the channel for those lines (possibly general lab-supply houses or VWR/Thermo catalogues) remains unidentified. DWK''s own site was not searched within the budget.', '+49 9342 802-0', NULL, 'Otto-Schott-Str. 21, 97877 Wertheim, Germany', 'https://www.dwk.com/request-a-quote', 'https://dwk.com/na/locations/wertheim-germany', NULL);
