1 42 543 1111', NULL, '3-1-2 Musashino, Akishima, Tokyo 196-8558, Japan', 'https://www.jeol.com/contacts/products.php', 'https://www.globaldata.com/company-profile/jeol-ltd/locations/', NULL);
