e page, a news item that it distributes Mettler-Toledo Rainin pipettes, and balance/titration/scale product pages. No Mettler-Toledo Israeli subsidiary was found; phone numbers and the exact scope split were taken from search snippets and not re-checked on the live page. Agentek''s own vendors page (agentek.co.il/vendors) lists the brand among the manufacturers it represents in Israel (seen in a search excerpt; the manufacturer''s own distributor page was not opened).', '+1 614-438-4511', NULL, '1900 Polaris Parkway, Columbus, OH 43240, USA', NULL, 'https://s202.q4cdn.com/258391627/files/doc_financials/2014-Annual-Report.pdf', 'Q680186');
INSERT INTO products VALUES (847, 1, 'XPR analytical & micro balances', 'high-precision laboratory balances', 'prior', NULL);
INSERT INTO products VALUES (847, 2, 'Rainin Pipet-Lite XLS / E4 XLS', 'manual and electronic pipettes', 'prior', NULL);
INSERT INTO products VALUES (847, 3, 'Excellence Titrators & SevenExcellence meters', 'titration and pH/ion analysis', 'prior', NULL);
INSERT INTO israel_entities VALUES (847, 'Agentek (1987) Ltd.', 'אגנטק', 'distributor', 'Mettler-Toledo laboratory weighing (balances, calibration weights), Rainin pipettes (Vero electronic, MicroPro 96-channel), CHRONECT XPR automated dispensing, EasyViewer/iC Vision process analytics, plus industrial scales and product-inspection metal detectors - live Agentek representative page and product pages', 'https://agentek.co.il', '+972 9-965-7000', NULL, 'Greenwork Yakum Business Park, Yakum 6097200', 'https://agentek.co.il/contact/', 2026, 'current', 'prior_research', NULL, 'https://agentek.co.il/representative/mettler-toledo/');
INSERT INTO israel_entities VALUES (847, 'Modcon Systems Ltd.', NULL, 'distributor', 'process analytics (Ingold sensors/transmitters); Akko, +972 4 9553955', 'https://modcon-systems.com', '+972-4-9553955', NULL, 'Modcon House, M. Boronshtein St., South Akko Industrial Park, Akko 24222', NULL, NULL, 'older_evidence', 'prior_research', NULL, 'https://www.mt.com/il/en/home.html');
