e brief''s hint list, where Ornat appears). Hebrew search could not be run (budget exhausted). Tool limits in this session: the shared web-search budget was exhausted after the first round of searches and all page fetches (WebFetch/curl) were blocked, so manufacturer distributor/contact pages could not be opened and some Hebrew searches could not be run. Size figures marked ''recalled'' come from company filings/pages as known to the researcher (knowledge to mid-2026) and were not re-verified against a fetched source.', '+1 978-928-5054', 'info@neb.com', '240 County Road, Ipswich, MA 01938-2723, USA', 'https://www.neb.com/en-us/support/international-ordering-support', 'https://www.neb.com/en-us/support/international-ordering-support', NULL);
