scribed official Israeli distributor of 250+ antibody/protein suppliers) and Danyel, Gamidor and HyLabs pages, none of which mention R&D Systems, Novus, Tocris or ProteinSimple in any snippet. Bio-Techne''s FY2025 10-K states it ''has not historically had significant business in Russia, Ukraine or Israel''. Getter Bio-Med''s posts describe it as the official Israeli representative of Lunaphore, a Bio-Techne brand; no channel found for R&D Systems / ProteinSimple products. Novus Biologicals'' (Bio-Techne) distributor page lists an unnamed Israeli distributor at 6 Hasadna St., Kfar Saba (identity not resolved).', '+1 800-343-7475', 'techsupport@bio-techne.com', '614 McKinley Place NE, Minneapolis, MN 55413, USA', 'https://rndsystems.com/node/64566', 'https://rndsystems.com/node/64566', NULL);
