lf, Jenway, Techne or Environmental Express; Masterflex is now Avantor and was not searched. Antylia''s own ''find a distributor'' page was not fetched (fetching blocked). Corporate note seen in snippet: Brookfield and CDPQ completed the acquisition of Antylia Scientific for approximately USD 1.3 billion (CDPQ news release).', '+1 800-323-4340', 'sales@antylia.com', '625 East Bunker Court, Vernon Hills, IL 60061, USA', NULL, 'https://www.thomasnet.com/company/cole-parmer-1148924/profile', NULL);
