/נציג/יבואן) found no Israeli entity (only Verder Scientific South Africa and US pages). Domain-restricted search found multiple mrclab.com pages selling Carbolite Gero ovens/furnaces; nothing surfaced for Retsch, Eltra, Microtrac or QATM on the Israeli distributor domains. Whether MRC is the official Carbolite Gero distributor or a reseller is not stated in the snippet; Verder''s regional contact pages were not fetched.', '+49 2104 2333-500', 'info@verder-scientific.com', 'Retsch-Allee 1-5, 42781 Haan, Germany', 'https://www.verder-scientific.com/contact', 'https://www.verder-scientific.com/contact', NULL);
INSERT INTO products VALUES (1080, 1, 'Retsch mills and sieve shakers', 'planetary ball mills, cutting mills, AS 200 sieving', 'prior', NULL);
INSERT INTO products VALUES (1080, 2, 'Carbolite Gero furnaces', 'laboratory chamber, tube and high-temperature furnaces', 'prior', NULL);
