the ''Tecan Israel partner Gamidor/Eldan/Rhenium'' query were blocked by the exhausted budget. Gamidor Diagnostics appears in the brief''s list of known Israeli diagnostics distributors. The channel for Tecan''s life-science automation (Fluent/Freedom EVO/Spark) in Israel remains unestablished. Tool limits in this session: the shared web-search budget was exhausted after the first round of searches and all page fetches (WebFetch/curl) were blocked, so manufacturer distributor/contact pages could not be opened and some Hebrew searches could not be run. Size figures marked ''recalled'' come from company filings/pages as known to the researcher (knowledge to mid-2026) and were not re-verified against a fetched source.', '+41 44 922 81 11', 'info@tecan.com', 'Seestrasse 103, 8708 Männedorf, Switzerland', 'https://www.tecan.com/contact-us', 'https://www.tecanannualreport.com/annual-report-2022/global', NULL);
INSERT INTO products VALUES (1237, 1, 'Fluent', 'automated liquid-handling workstation', 'prior', NULL);
INSERT INTO products VALUES (1237, 2, 'Freedom EVO', 'modular liquid-handling and robotics platform', 'prior', NULL);
INSERT INTO products VALUES (1237, 3, 'Spark', 'multimode microplate reader', 'prior', NULL);
INSERT INTO israel_entities VALUES (1237, 'Gamidor Diagnostics (1984) Ltd.', 'גמידור דיאגנוסטיקה', 'distributor', 'Listed as Tecan''s Israel contact on tecan.com''s live Contact Us page: Shaham 32, Petah Tikva, +972-3-9277286, contact Mr. Moshe Cohen; described as specialising in development, production and distribution of automated workflow solutions for life-science laboratories (i.e. the lab-automation line, not only diagnostics/LC-MS kits)', 'https://www.gamidor.co.il', '+972-3-927-7277', 'info@gamidor.co.il', 'Shaham 32, Petach Tikva', NULL, 2026, 'current', 'prior_research', NULL, 'https://www.tecan.com/contact-us');
